Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 10/19] FreeChat: report the media of own disappearing messages

The SDK encrypts attachments itself, so after sending, the MXCs of the
message's files and thumbnails go to the server's event_media endpoint, which
deletes them when the message expires.
